{"comment": "Nothing on the a-file can pass alice's own pawn on a4, so a1a8 is illegal in every start position and costs nothing."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 4, "type": "game.act", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 2, "action": {"kind": "move", "move": "a1a8"}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 4, "type": "error", "body": {"code": "illegal_action", "message": "illegal move: a1a8"}}}
{"comment": "bob resigns: both players get the finished game with its summary, digest and the PGN export."}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 4, "type": "game.control", "body": {"game_id": "$game", "seq": 2, "control": "resign"}}}
